		],
		"en": [
			"• Build Strike's final evolution, \"Build Strike Galaxy Cosmos\", which appears in episode 5 of \"Gundam Build Fighters Battlogue\", is now available in HGBF!",
			"• The completely new backpack has 12 wings that can be changed into various shapes, allowing you to recreate styles reminiscent of stars and cosmos!",
			"• Power up with many new parts such as head, chest, shoulders, legs, etc.!"
